      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's AMD specific known bug because VR headset takes heavy load with bandwidth/power on USB !\nPls refer to this site \"https://www.tomshardware.com/news/usb-fix-400-500-series-motherboards-amd\" and update your BIOS from your motherboard's manufacturer, other option is use PCIE USB extend card if issue still present or you don't want to update your BIOS.",
