  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-08-17T23:47:00.251Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When I launch Vrchat when using PCIe Gen 4 for my GPU the game will load into a world and 5 seconds later grey screen consistently. This only happened after I had upgraded to a Gigabyte 3070 OC edition. After tinkering I found that forcing the motherboard to use the slot as a PCIe Gen 3 slot the game worked fine with no grey screens. \nSpec wise I have a ryzen 5800x, RTX 3070, B550 elite motherboard, and Valve Index.",
